      "system": {
        "notes": {
         "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>As a Free Action, the Cult Fanatic can make a Challenging (+0) Willpower Test to enter a frenzied state. While frenzied, their Strength Bonus increases by +1, and they are immune to the Frightened Condition. On their turn, they must attempt to engage the nearest enemy in melee combat. They must remain in this state until all enemies they can currently see have been defeated, or until they are affected by the Stunned or Unconscious Condition.</p>"
